   "pron": "ne-the-SI-to",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "verb",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "It says what you lack: «Necesito pan». With a verb after it, use the infinitive.",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
